 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. BADNM.
* 2026-11-22, DECISIONS 8.10: names that break
* ProDOS's rules are refused with FILE STATUS "31".
* Expected: B1 31 / B2 31 / B3 31 / B4 31 / B5 31 /
* B6 31 / B7 00 / B8 00 / B9 35 / B10 31 / DONE
* (leaves GOOD.DAT - cp2 delete it)
 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
 FILE-CONTROL.
     SELECT F ASSIGN TO WS-NAME
         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
         RELATIVE KEY IS K
         FILE STATUS IS S.
     SELECT G ASSIGN TO "BAD NAME.DAT"
         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
         RELATIVE KEY IS K
         FILE STATUS IS S2.
 DATA DIVISION.
 FILE SECTION.
 FD  F.
 01  R           PIC X(10).
 FD  G.
 01  R2          PIC X(10).
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  WS-NAME.
     05  WN1     PIC X(40).
     05  WN2     PIC X(40).
 01  K           PIC 9(4) COMP.
 01  S           PIC XX.
 01  S2          PIC XX.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE "MY FILE!.DAT" TO WS-NAME.
     OPEN OUTPUT F. DISPLAY "B1 " S.
     OPEN INPUT F. DISPLAY "B2 " S.
     MOVE "1ABC.DAT" TO WS-NAME.
     OPEN OUTPUT F. DISPLAY "B3 " S.
     MOVE "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP" TO WS-NAME.
     OPEN OUTPUT F. DISPLAY "B4 " S.
     MOVE "A//B" TO WS-NAME.
     OPEN OUTPUT F. DISPLAY "B5 " S.
     MOVE "/COBOL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA/BBBBBBBBBBBBBBB/C"
         TO WN1.
     MOVE "CCCCCCCCCCCCCC/DDDDDDDDDD.DAT" TO WN2.
     OPEN INPUT F. DISPLAY "B6 " S.
     MOVE "good.dat" TO WS-NAME.
     OPEN OUTPUT F. DISPLAY "B7 " S.
     MOVE 1 TO K. MOVE "HELLO" TO R. WRITE R.
     CLOSE F.
     OPEN INPUT F. DISPLAY "B8 " S.
     CLOSE F.
     MOVE "NOSUCH.DAT" TO WS-NAME.
     OPEN INPUT F. DISPLAY "B9 " S.
     OPEN OUTPUT G. DISPLAY "B10 " S2.
     DISPLAY "DONE".
     STOP RUN.
